  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Have a feature that allows the keyframing of a camera on a set path. For example, set your camera down at one point, and have it record the motion to a different point. Then be able to play back that motion for recordings (on the x, y, and z axis to include rotation). It would make cinematography and editing much more fluid, and I'm not sure if there is something in the works for it at the moment, but it would help a lot of us out.",
